WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:21.211
"Ow! It hurts!" cried Mole.

2
00:00:21.212 --> 00:00:25.487
He was rolling in the snow, holding his leg.

3
00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:29.077
"Poor Mole," said Rat kindly.

4
00:00:29.078 --> 00:00:30.747
"Let me look."

5
00:00:30.748 --> 00:00:35.478
Mole sat still, and Rat bent down.

6
00:00:35.479 --> 00:00:40.181
"Well, you really hurt yourself," said Rat.

7
00:00:40.182 --> 00:00:44.149
"I tripped over a stump," cried Mole.

8
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.772
"But it's a clean cut," said Rat.

9
00:00:47.773 --> 00:00:52.667
"It looks like you hit something sharp, like metal."

10
00:00:52.668 --> 00:00:56.490
"It hurts!" cried Mole.

11
00:00:56.491 --> 00:01:00.673
Rat tied up Mole's cut with his handkerchief.

12
00:01:00.674 --> 00:01:06.769
"Hmm, metal," said Rat. "I wonder."

13
00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:11.690
Rat started scratching in the snow.

14
00:01:11.691 --> 00:01:15.153
"What are you doing?" asked Mole.

15
00:01:15.154 --> 00:01:19.472
Rat didn't answer, but he dug harder.

16
00:01:19.473 --> 00:01:22.237
"Hey!" cried Mole.

17
00:01:22.238 --> 00:01:24.816
"What's going on?"

18
00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:28.140
Suddenly Rat stood.

19
00:01:28.141 --> 00:01:31.134
He held something in his hand.

20
00:01:31.135 --> 00:01:34.739
"What did you find, Ratty?" asked Mole.

21
00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.812
"Come and see!" said Rat.

22
00:01:37.813 --> 00:01:41.069
Mole walked over to have a look.

23
00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:45.946
"It looks like a broken door knocker," said Mole.

24
00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:49.070
"What does that tell you?" asked Rat.

25
00:01:49.071 --> 00:01:52.481
"Uh, nothing," said Mole.

26
00:01:52.482 --> 00:01:58.545
"Oh, stop standing there!" cried Rat. "Dig!"

27
00:01:58.546 --> 00:02:02.088
Rat clawed at the snow.

28
00:02:02.089 --> 00:02:05.606
White flakes flew all around him.

29
00:02:05.607 --> 00:02:10.285
"Why are you so excited?" asked Mole.

30
00:02:10.286 --> 00:02:15.481
Rat just kept digging, so Mole dug too.

31
00:02:15.482 --> 00:02:20.685
"I don't know what we're digging for," said Mole.

32
00:02:20.686 --> 00:02:24.136
"It was just an old door knocker."

33
00:02:24.137 --> 00:02:27.177
Suddenly Rat stopped.

34
00:02:27.178 --> 00:02:32.145
"Look at this!" he shouted.

35
00:02:32.146 --> 00:02:39.720
Mole looked. There was something under the snow.
